<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini shares rise on forecast.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini shares rise on forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cap Geminiwere up strongly on Wednesday after the company reported higher first-half profits on Tuesay evening and said its full-year results could be up 80 percent.</p>
<p>At 0829 GMT, Cap Gemini was up 3.51 percent at 365.50 francs.</p>
